<li><img alt="" src="../images/down.gif"> <a href="#proxy">Proxying and Forwarding</a></li>
<li><img alt="" src="../images/down.gif"> <a href="#websocket">WebSocket</a></li>
<li><img alt="" src="../images/down.gif"> <a href="#cgi">CGI</a></li>
